OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused Manchester's Co-op Live
OL,5,Aevacuation
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne woman was taken to hospital for
OL,8,Ftreatment, while 88 other people were
OL,9,Fassessed by paramedics for "eye and
OL,10,Frespiratory symptoms".
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,13,Fdetectives were trying to establish
OL,14,Fwhat the substance was and where it
OL,15,Fcame from and further testing was
OL,16,Ftaking place on items found at the
OL,17,Fvenue.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
